CON_0251	ADD_0037	rda_graph:ADD_0037	Gamification in RDM Training - Let's play!		https://zenodo.org/records/8094600				DOI	https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8094600	2023-06-29	Context: This presentation was given on February 15 2023 within the context of the RDA DE 2023 ( https://www.rda-deutschland.de/events/rda-de-2023 ), as second part of the session &quot; Gamification &ndash; Praktischer Einsatz des Trends in der FDM Kompetenzvermittlung &quot; (pt. 1: https://indico.desy.de/event/37011/contributions/132888/ , pt. 2: https://indico.desy.de/event/37011/contributions/132895/ ). Part 1 is also available on Zenodo: Assmann et al. (2023). Pr&auml;sentation zum Workshop: Gamification &ndash; Praktischer Einsatz des Trends in der FDM Kompetenzvermittlung. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7744209 . &nbsp; Description: This contribution to the gamification session gives a sneak peek on the FAIR Cards (Wilbrandt, in prep.) and afterwards instructs the participants to play two adapted online games using research data management (RDM) terms: CodeNames and Taboo. The intention behind adapting existing games to RDM training is to help make the topic fun. Incorporating on-topic games in RDM training helps to raise awareness, remember the lessons learned, and to discuss the important aspects with peers. To play CodeNames, the uploaded list CodeNames.txt was used as custom word pack. For Taboo, the uploaded list Taboo.txt was used: a word was picked at random (judging by eye) and given to a player via private chat. &nbsp; Duration: The session is intended to take 1,5 h. This includes: 10 min introduction and explanation of CodeNames 45 min playing CodeNames at https://codenames.game 5 min questions and discussion 5 min explanation of Taboo 15 min playing Taboo 10 min questions and discussion Target Audience: Data Stewards and other RDM professionals delivering training Anyone interested Image Sources: CodeNames https://bestfamilyboardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Codenames-1.jpg https://codenames.game Taboo https://d3fa68hw0m2vcc.cloudfront.net/aab/6720192.jpeg Upload Contents: 2023-02-15_RDA_Games.pdf 2023-02-15_RDA_Games.key CodeNames.txt Taboo.txt &nbsp;	eng	publication-presentation	info:eu-repo/semantics/presentation		\N	\N	\N	\N
